    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In a geometric progression, the 3rd term is 24 and the 6th term is 3. Find the smallest value of $n$ such that the $n$-th term is less than 0.01.",
    "question_zh": "在一個等比數列中，第 3 項為 24，第 6 項為 3。求使得第 $n$ 項小於 0.01 的最小整數 $n$。",
    "options": [
      "A. 14",
      "B. 15",
      "C. 16",
      "D. 17"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "$ar^2 = 24$ and $ar^5 = 3$. Dividing gives $r^3 = 1/8 \\Rightarrow r = 1/2$.",
      "$a(1/4) = 24 \\Rightarrow a = 96$.",
      "We want $96(0.5)^{n-1} < 0.01 \\Rightarrow (0.5)^{n-1} < 0.0001041...$",
      "Using logs: $(n-1) \\log 0.5 < \\log 0.0001041 \\Rightarrow (n-1) > 13.22 \\Rightarrow n > 14.22$.",
      "Smallest integer $n = 15$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "$ar^2 = 24$, $ar^5 = 3 \\Rightarrow r^3 = 1/8 \\Rightarrow r = 1/2$。",
      "$a(1/4) = 24 \\Rightarrow a = 96$。",
      "$96(0.5)^{n-1} < 0.01 \\Rightarrow (0.5)^{n-1} < 0.0001041$。",
      "取對數：$(n-1) \\log 0.5 < \\log 0.0001041 \\Rightarrow n-1 > 13.22 \\Rightarrow n = 15$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_162",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_alg_apgp",
      "math_alg_log_exp"
    ],
    "marks": 3,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The population of a city doubles every 5 years. If the current population is $P_0$, find the minimum number of years required for the population to exceed $10P_0$.",
    "question_zh": "某城市的入口每 5 年翻倍一次。若現時人口為 $P_0$，求人口超過 $10P_0$ 所需的最小年數。",
    "options": [
      "A. 16",
      "B. 17",
      "C. 18",
      "D. 19"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "$P = P_0 (2)^{t/5}$. We need $P_0 (2)^{t/5} > 10P_0 \\Rightarrow (2)^{t/5} > 10$.",
      "Taking logs: $\\frac{t}{5} \\log 2 > \\log 10 = 1$.",
      "$t > \\frac{5}{\\log 2} \\approx \\frac{5}{0.3010} \\approx 16.61$.",
      "The minimum number of years is 17."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "$P = P_0 (2)^{t/5}$。我們需要 $(2)^{t/5} > 10$。",
      "取對數：$\\frac{t}{5} \\log 2 > 1 \\Rightarrow t > 5 / \\log 2 \\approx 16.61$。",
      "最小整數年數為 17 年。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
