    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In the figure, the semi-vertical angle of a right circular cone is $30^\\circ$. Find the ratio of its curved surface area to its base area.",
    "question_zh": "圖中，一直立圓錐的半頂角為 $30^\\circ$。求其曲面面積與底面積之比。",
    "options": [
      "A. $1:2$",
      "B. $2:1$",
      "C. $3:1$",
      "D. $\\sqrt{3}:1$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let radius be $r$ and height be $h$. $\\sin 30^\\circ = r/l$, where $l$ is slant height.",
      "$1/2 = r/l \\Rightarrow l = 2r$.",
      "Curved surface area $S = \\pi r l = \\pi r (2r) = 2\\pi r^2$.",
      "Base area $B = \\pi r^2$.",
      "Ratio $S:B = 2\\pi r^2 : \\pi r^2 = 2:1$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設半徑為 $r$，母線（側面高）為 $l$。$\\sin 30^\\circ = r/l$。",
      "$1/2 = r/l \\Rightarrow l = 2r$。",
      "曲面面積 $S = \\pi r l = 2\\pi r^2$。",
      "底面積 $B = \\pi r^2$。",
      "比例 $S:B = 2:1$。"
    ],
