    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "As shown in the figure, $VABCD$ is a right pyramid with a square base $ABCD$ of side length 10 cm. The height $VM$ of the pyramid is 12 cm, where $M$ is the center of the base. Find the angle between the edge $VB$ and the base.",
    "question_zh": "如圖所示，$VABCD$ 為一直立稜錐，其正方形底 $ABCD$ 的邊長為 10 cm。稜錐的高度 $VM$ 為 12 cm，其中 $M$ 為底面的中心。求側稜 $VB$ 與底面的交角。",
    "options": [
      "A. $45.0^\\circ$",
      "B. $50.2^\\circ$",
      "C. $59.5^\\circ$",
      "D. $67.4^\\circ$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The angle is $\\angle VBM$. $M$ is the center of the square base $ABCD$.",
      "$MB = \\frac{1}{2} (\\text{Diagonal}) = \\frac{1}{2} \\sqrt{10^2 + 10^2} = 5\\sqrt{2} \\approx 7.07$ cm.",
      "In right-angled $\\triangle VBM$, $\\tan(\\angle VBM) = \\frac{VM}{MB} = \\frac{12}{5\\sqrt{2}} \\approx 1.697$.",
      "$\\angle VBM = \\arctan(1.697) \\approx 59.5^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "該角為 $\\angle VBM$。$M$ 為底面正方形的中心。",
      "$MB = 1/2 \\times 10\\sqrt{2} = 5\\sqrt{2} \\approx 7.07$ cm。",
      "在直角 $\\triangle VBM$ 中，$\\tan(\\angle VBM) = 12 / (5\\sqrt{2}) \\approx 1.697$。",
      "$\\angle VBM \\approx 59.5^\\circ$。"
    ],
