      "math_alg_functions"
    ],
    "marks": 3,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The vertex of the parabola $y = x^2 - 6x + k$ lies on the $x$-axis. Find the value of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "拋物線 $y = x^2 - 6x + k$ 的頂點位於 $x$ 軸上。求 $k$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. 3",
      "B. 6",
      "C. 9",
      "D. 12"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "If the vertex lies on the $x$-axis, the quadratic has only one real root (a perfect square).",
      "The discriminant $\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac$ must be zero.",
      "$(-6)^2 - 4(1)(k) = 0 \\Rightarrow 36 - 4k = 0$.",
      "$4k = 36 \\Rightarrow k = 9$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "頂點在 $x$ 軸上代表該二次方程只有一實根（完全平方式）。",
      "判別式 $\\Delta = (-6)^2 - 4(k) = 0$。",
      "$36 = 4k \\Rightarrow k = 9$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
