    "question_en": "In the figure, a parabola passes through $(0,5)$ and has its vertex at $(2,1)$. Find the equation of the axis of symmetry of the parabola.",
    "question_zh": "圖中，一拋物線經過 $(0,5)$ 且頂點位於 $(2,1)$。求該拋物線的對稱軸方程。",
    "options": [
      "A. $x = 1$",
      "B. $x = 2$",
      "C. $y = 1$",
      "D. $y = 2$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "For any parabola written in vertex form $y = a(x-h)^2 + k$, the vertex is $(h,k)$.",
      "Here, the vertex is $(2,1)$, so the axis of symmetry is the vertical line passing through $x=2$.",
      "The equation is $x=2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "對於頂點式 $y = a(x-h)^2 + k$，頂點為 $(h,k)$。",
      "頂點為 $(2,1)$，因此對稱軸為通過 $x=2$ 的鉛垂線。",
      "方程為 $x=2$。"
    ],
